1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,790
5 words to never say in AI copywriting.

2
00:00:03,970 --> 00:00:11,240
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say game-changer, instead say turns things around - because

3
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:14,110
people cliche alerts.

4
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:19,260
Don't say leverage, instead say apply - leveraged is AI-slop.

5
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:24,100
Don't say delve, instead say dig into - nobody says delve.

6
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:28,720
Don't say in today's world, instead say right now - timeless.

7
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:33,870
Don't say empower, instead say help - empower is corporate noise.

8
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:38,630
Your AI copywriting does not have to sound like everyone else's.

9
00:00:38,810 --> 00:00:42,510
Comment 'MOVE' and I will send you the full list.

10
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:46,480
Make sure you follow - it only goes to followers.
